config BR2_PACKAGE_FATRESIZE
	bool "fatresize"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_PARTED
	help
	  fatresize: grow (or shrink) a FAT16/FAT32 filesystem in place
	  with libparted's fs-resize library, moving the partition
	  boundary in the same run. RelicOS (M19) uses it once, on the
	  first boot, to grow the user partition RELICOS to the end of
	  whatever card the image was written to. Not in Buildroot
	  upstream; the recipe lives in this external tree.

	  https://github.com/ya-mouse/fatresize
